# CORE_JS — encapsulation

**This repo = generic JS platform.** No app domain, no `<core-*>` UI.

- Primitives → **CORE_JS** | Kit UI → **CORE_UX** | PHP platform → **CORE_PHP** | Product → **consuming app**
- Rules/skills for `$svc`, base classes, ESM → **this repo** (`.cursor/`, `ai-instructions/`)
- Docs use **local paths only** — must work standalone and when symlinked in an app workspace

Details: `ai-instructions/layering.md`, `ai-instructions/encapsulation.md`.
